DESCRIPTION:Join the Gregg Museum of Art & Design for an evening that will 
 begin with an intimate artist talk by ariana Farquharson\, offering a behi
 nd-the-scenes look at the personal narratives and techniques that shaped t
 he exhibition\, You Are Here: Geolocating the Self through the Familiar in
  the Midst of the Unfamiliar. The exhibition will be on display in the art
  gallery at the African American Cultural Center from Oct. 28\, 2026\, to 
  Feb. 28\, 2027.
GEO:35.785108;-78.674529
LOCATION:Witherspoon Student Center\, African American Cultural Center (201
